dia. 22K is commonly used for jewellery, while 24K is preferred for coins and investment purposes. How often are gold prices updated in India? Gold prices are updated multiple times a day to reflect changes in the international market and currency fluctuations. Can I buy gold online in India? Yes, many reputed jewellers and investment platforms in India offer online gold buying options for coins, bars, and digital gold with secure payment and delivery. Where can I buy gold in India? Gold can be purchased from jewellery stores, banks, government-authorized dealers, or online platforms such as Tanishq, Malabar Gold, and MMTC-PAMP. Is gold a good investment in India? Yes. Gold is considered a safe-haven asset and a long-term investment in India, often used for wealth preservation and protection against inflation. Gold Price in India States/Cities (Indian Rupee) City/State Gram 24K Gram 22K Delhi 14,651 13,430 Chennai 13,984 12,818 Kolkata 14,424 13,222 Mumbai 14,608 13,391 Kerala 14,268 13,079 Goa 14,197 13,014 Bangalore 13,955 12,792 Hyderabad 14,012 12,844 Assam 14,173 12,992 Andaman and Nicobar 14,211 13,027 Andhra Pradesh 13,781 12,632 Arunachal Pradesh 14,211 13,027 Bihar 14,173 12,992 Chhattisgarh 13,781 12,632 Daman and Diu 14,211 13,027 Gujarat 14,432 13,230 Haryana 14,197 13,014 Himachal Pradesh 14,197 13,014 Jammu and Kashmir 14,197 13,014 Jharkhand 14,173 12,992 Karnataka 13,805 12,654 Lakshadweep 14,211 13,027 Madhya Pradesh 14,347 13,152 Maharashtra 14,347 13,152 Manipur 14,211 13,027 Meghalaya 14,211 13,027 Mizoram 14,211 13,027 Nagaland 14,211 13,027 Odisha 13,781 12,632 Puducherry 14,211 13,027 Punjab 14,197 13,014 Rajasthan 14,432 13,230 Sikkim 14,211 13,027 Tamil Nadu 13,805 12,654 Tripura 14,211 13,027 Uttar Pradesh 14,197 13,014 Uttarakhand 14,197 13,014 West Bengal 14,173 12,992 Ahmedabad 14,715 13,489 Chandigarh 14,298 13,106 Amritsar 14,296 13,105 Coimbatore 13,961 12,798 Gurgaon 14,269 13,080 Howrah 14,509 13,300 Jammu 14,394 13,195 Kochi 13,912